      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="ES">Advance at Oct /2021

3 published blogs:
?	https://www.co.undp.org/content/colombia/es/home/Blog/2021/enero/reimagining-development-for-the-21st-century--accelerator-lab-in.html
?	https://www.co.undp.org/content/colombia/es/home/Blog/2021/Mayo/testing-out-new-ways-of-regional-development-in-colombia.html
?	https://medium.com/@undp.innovation/bringing-the-system-into-the-room-an-experience-from-colombia-b8329e1b0310

&#x2022;	10 mapped solutions included at the global platform of the AccLabs
Empathy Soltions : Paca Digestora, Econativa, Platos Comestibles, Homegenizador de panela, Bicicleta de carga (Vivero+Materas)

&#x2022;	2 new sources of data 
o Real time data (Social Networks, web) through an artificial intelligence service (Citibeats)
o Drone information to generate 3D models &gt;&gt; Dronedeploy + SketchUp

&#x2022;	2 methodologies and tools adjusted, implemented or implemented with the accompaniment of Acclab that generate value for the CO and strategic allies

&#x2022; The portfolio perspective has been included in the strategic projects (Yanama in La Guajira, Portfolio Design with Chora, Reactivation with USAID and Peace Corridors with Sweden)
&#x2022; Deepening the collaborative financing exercise, this time supporting the creation and launch of the UNDP crowdfunding platform: www.tuaporte.reactivacci&#xf3;n.co
&#x2022; Horizontal Scanning (Fintech in Colombia)

&#x2022; 2 scaled methodologies in CO projects and strategic allies
o Collective Mapping of Solutions in Manizales
o Empathy sessions (Guajira and Mojana empathy workshops)

&#x2022; 3 experiments detected, explored, tested and escalated by the CO and strategic allies
o An experiment to test the transmissibility was developed in partnership with the Universidad de los Andes
o Drone for development in three uses cases:
o Use of drones for crisis context: Enhancement of HBDA - Impact Mapping (Hurricane and floods)
o Use of drones for reforestation mapping (Forests in Mojana)
o Use of drones for Land Use Planning/management (Multipurpose Cadastre)</narrative>
