       <narrative xml:lang="ES">&#x2022;	7 blogs published
&#x2022;	2 tools designed and used by projects of the Country Office and strategic partners
&#x2022;	2 methodologies designed and used by projects of the Country Office and strategic partners
&#x2022;	3 experiments sensed, explored, tested, and scaled
